[{"text": "The assembly will now hear an address", "start": 4.16, "duration": 7.84}, {"text": "by His Excellency Dumagi Dion Bo,", "start": 8.4, "duration": 7.359}, {"text": "president of the Republic of Botswana.", "start": 12.0, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "I request protocol to escort his", "start": 15.759, "duration": 4.881}, {"text": "excellency and invite him to address the", "start": 18.0, "duration": 5.64}, {"text": "assembly.", "start": 20.64, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "Mr. President,", "start": 34.48, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "Botswana warmly congratulates you on", "start": 37.04, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "your election to preside over the 81st", "start": 39.6, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "session of the United Nations General", "start": 43.28, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "Assembly.", "start": 46.16, "duration": 4.719}, {"text": "We assure you of our full support as you", "start": 47.84, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "should this important responsibility.", "start": 50.879, "duration": 6.641}, {"text": "We also commend the outgoing president", "start": 55.28, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "for a distinguished stewardship.", "start": 57.52, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "Her tenure reminds us of an unfinished", "start": 60.879, "duration": 4.721}, {"text": "chapter in the history of this", "start": 63.92, "duration": 3.76}, {"text": "organization.", "start": 65.6, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "Eight decades later, the United Nations", "start": 67.68, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "has yet to be led by a woman as", "start": 71.2, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "Secretary General.", "start": 74.72, "duration": 5.439}, {"text": "Mr. President, the theme of this", "start": 78.24, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "session, restoring trust, managing", "start": 80.159, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "transformation,", "start": 84.4, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "a United Nations that delivers for all", "start": 86.159, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "aptly captures the central challenge", "start": 89.2, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "before us.", "start": 91.439, "duration": 5.121}, {"text": "Restoring trust requires fidelity to the", "start": 93.68, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "UN charter and international law.", "start": 96.56, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "Managing transformation requires", "start": 100.56, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "institutions capable of adapting to a", "start": 102.56, "duration": 6.559}, {"text": "rapidly changing world. And delivering", "start": 105.759, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "for all requires us to move beyond", "start": 109.119, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "declarations towards tangible", "start": 112.159, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "improvements in the lives and", "start": 114.799, "duration": 4.481}, {"text": "livelihoods of our peoples.", "start": 116.399, "duration": 5.441}, {"text": "Ultimately, our declarations,", "start": 119.28, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "communicators, and resolutions must", "start": 121.84, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "travel the difficult road from this", "start": 124.56, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "assembly hall to the daily lives of the", "start": 126.799, "duration": 5.681}, {"text": "peoples we represent.", "start": 129.759, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "Persistent conflicts, geopolitical", "start": 132.48, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "tensions, and growing divisions have", "start": 135.52, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "tested trust between nations.", "start": 138.239, "duration": 4.481}, {"text": "Concurrently,", "start": 141.2, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "our world is undergoing transformation", "start": 142.72, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "driven by technology, climate change,", "start": 145.52, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "demographic shifts, and changing", "start": 149.68, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "patterns of economic power.", "start": 152.08, "duration": 5.439}, {"text": "The pertinent question is how we", "start": 155.44, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "strengthen multilateralism", "start": 157.519, "duration": 4.641}, {"text": "so that the United Nations can deliver", "start": 159.92, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "meaningful results for all member", "start": 162.16, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "states. Humanity has traveled far enough", "start": 164.8, "duration": 6.719}, {"text": "to know that on the great challenges of", "start": 168.64, "duration": 6.879}, {"text": "our age, none of us can go it alone.", "start": 171.519, "duration": 7.201}, {"text": "Whether a nation of a billion people or", "start": 175.519, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "like Botswana with just over two and a", "start": 178.72, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "half million people, we share one", "start": 180.72, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "fragile planet and one imperfect but", "start": 183.36, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "irreplaceable United Nations.", "start": 186.64, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "The choices we make will determine", "start": 189.84, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "whether multilateralism restores trust,", "start": 191.76, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "manages transformation and delivers for", "start": 195.2, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "all or becomes a cautionary tale of", "start": 198.08, "duration": 6.799}, {"text": "promises made and forgotten.", "start": 201.92, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "Botswana comes to this podium with a", "start": 204.879, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "power and weight of genuine conviction.", "start": 206.879, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "When Botswana gained independence in", "start": 209.92, "duration": 3.44}, {"text": "1966,", "start": 211.84, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "we carried a founding belief that our", "start": 213.36, "duration": 5.439}, {"text": "security and prosperity would come from", "start": 216.56, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "disciplined integration into a community", "start": 218.799, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "of nations governed by rules that all", "start": 221.599, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "had agreed to honor. We honored our", "start": 224.72, "duration": 4.879}, {"text": "treaty obligations and opened our", "start": 227.84, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "economy in accordance with the norms of", "start": 229.599, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "this organization.", "start": 232.08, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "We regarded compliance with", "start": 234.959, "duration": 4.401}, {"text": "international law as one of Botswana's", "start": 236.72, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "strongest protections.", "start": 239.36, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "That is the tradition I bring to this", "start": 241.68, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "podium. Representing a nation staking", "start": 243.92, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "its existence on the promise that shared", "start": 247.28, "duration": 6.239}, {"text": "rules faithfully observed remain", "start": 250.0, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "humanity's best instrument for peace and", "start": 253.519, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "prosperity.", "start": 256.32, "duration": 3.439}, {"text": "That tradition tests whether trust", "start": 257.919, "duration": 4.641}, {"text": "between nations large and small can be", "start": 259.759, "duration": 4.641}, {"text": "restored.", "start": 262.56, "duration": 3.919}, {"text": "Mr. President, restoring trust must", "start": 264.4, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "begin with restoring respect.", "start": 266.479, "duration": 6.321}, {"text": "Respect for sovereignty, territorial", "start": 270.0, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "integrity, and equal dignity of every", "start": 272.8, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "nation, regardless of its size, wealth,", "start": 275.759, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "or military power. For smaller states", "start": 279.12, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "such as Botswana, a rule-based", "start": 282.16, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "international order is an essential", "start": 284.88, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "safeguard. It assures us that", "start": 287.44, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "international relations will be governed", "start": 290.88, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "by the strength of agreed principles.", "start": 293.52, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "Botswana believes that rules that bind", "start": 296.88, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "only the weak are not rules and", "start": 299.36, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "principles applied selectively soon", "start": 302.56, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "cease to command respect.", "start": 305.52, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "That is why Botswana calls on this", "start": 308.08, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "general assembly, the security council", "start": 309.84, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "and every organ of the United Nations to", "start": 312.8, "duration": 5.119}, {"text": "recommmit to dialogue as the first", "start": 315.039, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "instrument of diplomacy.", "start": 317.919, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "Botswana has sought to live by this", "start": 320.56, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "principle as a host to the southern", "start": 322.72, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "African development community Saddak", "start": 325.52, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "secretariat through our contributions to", "start": 327.759, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "regional mediation and election", "start": 330.56, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "observation and through our consistent", "start": 332.8, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "commitment to the peaceful peaceful", "start": 335.28, "duration": 4.639}, {"text": "settlement of disputes.", "start": 337.68, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "Mr. President, even as we work to", "start": 339.919, "duration": 4.081}, {"text": "restore trust, our world is", "start": 341.84, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "transforming.", "start": 344.0, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "Climate change is no longer tomorrow's", "start": 345.84, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "warning. It is today's drought in", "start": 347.84, "duration": 6.799}, {"text": "Africa, floods in Asia,", "start": 350.96, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "rising seas in the Pacific, and", "start": 354.639, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "wildfires in Europe and the Americas.", "start": 357.36, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "For Botswana, custodian of the Okavangua", "start": 360.88, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "Delta, a UNESCO World Heritage site, and", "start": 364.08, "duration": 6.959}, {"text": "the Kalagari ecosystem, climate change", "start": 368.0, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "directly affects livelihoods, water", "start": 371.039, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "security, and biodiversity.", "start": 374.08, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "Botswana remains committed to the 30", "start": 377.28, "duration": 4.639}, {"text": "by30 target and the sustainable", "start": 379.28, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "management of our natural capital.", "start": 381.919, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "Mr. President, Africa has the youngest", "start": 384.96, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "population on earth. That is an", "start": 387.759, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "extraordinary asset if we invest in it.", "start": 390.479, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "But what is a demographic dividend today", "start": 394.0, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "can become a demographic crisis tomorrow", "start": 396.72, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "if opportunity does not keep pace with", "start": 400.4, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "aspiration.", "start": 403.36, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "Youth unemployment remains one of the", "start": 405.28, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "most urgent challenges of our time.", "start": 407.28, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "Managing it is a shared responsibility.", "start": 410.24, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "Botswana calls upon the United Nations", "start": 413.759, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "Development Program, the International", "start": 416.08, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "Labor Organization, and all relevant", "start": 418.56, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "multilateral institutions to make", "start": 421.68, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "technology transfer, skills development,", "start": 424.479, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "and capacity building funded priorities.", "start": 426.88, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "As we will all agree, the credibility of", "start": 430.88, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "our multilateral commitments will be", "start": 433.84, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "properly tested in development finance.", "start": 435.919, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "When countries have the means to invest", "start": 440.0, "duration": 4.639}, {"text": "in their people and when international", "start": 442.0, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "institutions respond effectively to", "start": 444.639, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "shared threats, trust is strengthened.", "start": 446.8, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "But when commitments remain out of reach", "start": 450.4, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "for those who need them most, confidence", "start": 452.56, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "in the system weakens.", "start": 455.599, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "Getting these fundamentals right is", "start": 458.319, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "central to restoring trust, managing", "start": 460.96, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "transformation, and building a united", "start": 464.24, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "nations that delivers for all.", "start": 467.039, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "The global financial architecture must", "start": 470.16, "duration": 4.719}, {"text": "therefore evolve to reflect the economic", "start": 472.24, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "realities of the 21st century, including", "start": 474.879, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "financing demands created by climate", "start": 478.56, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "change, technological transformation,", "start": 480.879, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "and the imperative for sustainable", "start": 483.44, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "development.", "start": 485.68, "duration": 4.639}, {"text": "Developing countries frequently face", "start": 487.28, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "borrowing costs several times higher", "start": 490.319, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "than those of wealthier nations because", "start": 493.28, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "the system was not designed with the", "start": 496.4, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "circumstances of the global south in", "start": 498.319, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "mind.", "start": 501.36, "duration": 3.679}, {"text": "Debt sustainability is a question of", "start": 502.879, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "development and fairness. When nations", "start": 505.039, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "spend more to service debt than invest", "start": 508.16, "duration": 6.559}, {"text": "in education, job creation or provision", "start": 511.199, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "of health care, trust in the system", "start": 514.719, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "erodess. Botswana calls upon this", "start": 517.44, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "assembly and the international financial", "start": 520.0, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "institutions to pursue reform of global", "start": 522.32, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "financial governance. This would give", "start": 525.04, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "developing countries a meaningful voice", "start": 527.68, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "and provide fair and predictable access", "start": 530.399, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "to concessional finance.", "start": 533.12, "duration": 4.719}, {"text": "We call upon the United Nations and its", "start": 535.839, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "financial partners to mobilize private", "start": 537.839, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "capital through innovative and blended", "start": 540.8, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "financing agreements that derisk", "start": 543.279, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "productive investment in developing", "start": 546.0, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "economies.", "start": 548.32, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "This is enlightened fairness and sound", "start": 550.0, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "economics.", "start": 554.8, "duration": 3.599}, {"text": "Capital should help create opportunity", "start": 556.48, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "where its impact can be felt.", "start": 558.399, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "Mr. President health is where the", "start": 561.68, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "promise of international solidarity is", "start": 564.0, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "tested most directly and Botswana speaks", "start": 566.0, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "from hardearned experience.", "start": 569.519, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "Three decades ago, a country faced an", "start": 572.24, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "HIV AIDS pandemic of such severity that", "start": 574.88, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "some questioned our long-term", "start": 579.2, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "resilience.", "start": 581.36, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "Through determined national leadership,", "start": 583.04, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "bold public investment, and sustainable", "start": 585.68, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "global partnership, Botswana built one", "start": 587.92, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "of the world's most comprehensive HIV", "start": 590.64, "duration": 4.879}, {"text": "AIDS treatment programs.", "start": 592.959, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "We achieved the UN AIDS 959595", "start": 595.519, "duration": 6.721}, {"text": "targets ahead of schedule and we became", "start": 598.88, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "the first African country to achieve", "start": 602.24, "duration": 4.719}, {"text": "World Health Organization silver tier", "start": 604.16, "duration": 5.679}, {"text": "status for the elimination of motherto-", "start": 606.959, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "child transmission of HIV.", "start": 609.839, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "Our experience demonstrates that when", "start": 613.279, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "national ownership and international", "start": 616.079, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "solidarity converge, seemingly", "start": 617.839, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "impossible challenges can be overcome.", "start": 620.399, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "This kind of practical solidarity", "start": 623.6, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "restores confidence in multilateralism.", "start": 626.079, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "We stand ready to share the lessons of", "start": 629.36, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "this experience through South South and", "start": 632.079, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "triangular cooperation.", "start": 634.32, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "Botswana attaches particular importance", "start": 637.279, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "to preserving UN AIDS, an indispensable", "start": 639.839, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "partner in our national response through", "start": 643.44, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "evidence-based policym, technical", "start": 646.24, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "assistance, resource mobilization, and", "start": 649.04, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "global advocacy.", "start": 652.079, "duration": 4.081}, {"text": "That partnership helped to mitigate an", "start": 654.0, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "epidemic by means of one of the world's", "start": 656.16, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "most successful national responses and", "start": 658.16, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "placed Botswana firmly on the path", "start": 661.92, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "towards ending HIV.", "start": 664.72, "duration": 6.799}, {"text": "AIDS as a public health threat by 2030.", "start": 667.04, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "Mr. President, Botswana supports reforms", "start": 671.519, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "that strengthen the effectiveness,", "start": 674.48, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "coherence, and responsiveness of the", "start": 676.399, "duration": 4.401}, {"text": "United Nations system.", "start": 678.48, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "We also believe that efficiency gains", "start": 680.8, "duration": 4.719}, {"text": "should be redeployed to strengthen the", "start": 683.04, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "capacity of the organization to prevent", "start": 685.519, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "conflict, address emerging security", "start": 687.92, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "threats and deliver meaningful results", "start": 690.48, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "in program countries in line with the", "start": 692.72, "duration": 7.119}, {"text": "UN80 vision. It is in this spirit that", "start": 695.12, "duration": 7.92}, {"text": "Botswana accords the highest priority to", "start": 699.839, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "its partnerships with the United Nations", "start": 703.04, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "Office of Counterterrorism,", "start": 705.04, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "UN Habitat, the International Trade", "start": 707.6, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "Center, the International Organization", "start": 710.079, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "for Migration among others.", "start": 712.399, "duration": 6.321}, {"text": "We particularly recognized UNOCT's", "start": 715.279, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "leadership role in strengthening the", "start": 718.72, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "United Nations collective efforts to", "start": 721.04, "duration": 6.239}, {"text": "prevent and counterterrorism and violent", "start": 723.36, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "extremism and in translating", "start": 727.279, "duration": 4.881}, {"text": "international commitments into practical", "start": 729.6, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "support for member states. Botswana", "start": 732.16, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "remains committed to further deepening", "start": 735.6, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "its cooperation with UNOCCT", "start": 738.16, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "and the wider United Nations system", "start": 741.36, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "through capacity building, technical", "start": 744.32, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "assistance, knowledge sharing and the", "start": 746.88, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "exchange of good practices.", "start": 750.24, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "Such partnerships demonstrate that a", "start": 752.959, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "responsive United Nations can build", "start": 755.839, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "trust, strengthen national capacity, and", "start": 757.839, "duration": 6.641}, {"text": "foster peace and security.", "start": 761.279, "duration": 6.321}, {"text": "Mr. President, no reform agenda,", "start": 764.48, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "including UN80, is complete without", "start": 767.6, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "addressing the longstanding inequities", "start": 770.399, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "within the Security Council. In this", "start": 772.72, "duration": 6.559}, {"text": "regard, Botswana reaffirms its support", "start": 775.839, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "for comprehensive Security Council", "start": 779.279, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "reform and aligns itself with a common", "start": 781.6, "duration": 6.239}, {"text": "African position as articulated in the", "start": 784.8, "duration": 7.76}, {"text": "Ezulin consensus and the CI declaration.", "start": 787.839, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "We believe that a security council that", "start": 792.56, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "continues to exclude Africa and Latin", "start": 794.639, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "America from permanent membership cannot", "start": 797.44, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "credibly claim to reflect contemporary", "start": 800.16, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "glo geopolitical realities.", "start": 802.8, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "We also call on the United Nations to", "start": 806.24, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "continue to explore the creation of an", "start": 808.24, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "inclusive international framework on", "start": 811.12, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "emerging technologies including", "start": 813.76, "duration": 4.879}, {"text": "artificial intelligence.", "start": 816.079, "duration": 6.961}, {"text": "We recognize technology as a bridge that", "start": 818.639, "duration": 7.361}, {"text": "narrows global inequality.", "start": 823.04, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "This extends to critical minerals, rare", "start": 826.0, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "earths and energy resources that power", "start": 829.04, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "the technological revolution, many of", "start": 832.8, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "which come from developing countries.", "start": 835.36, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "Therefore,", "start": 838.72, "duration": 3.28}, {"text": "developing countries must have a", "start": 840.24, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "meaningful voice in setting the", "start": 842.0, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "standards and safeguards that will", "start": 845.279, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "govern these technologies, ensuring that", "start": 847.68, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "they expand opportunities, support", "start": 851.12, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "decent work, and strengthen public", "start": 854.16, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "services while protecting human dignity,", "start": 856.8, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "rights, and security.", "start": 860.72, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "Mr. President, I wish to reaffirm", "start": 864.0, "duration": 2.88}, {"text": "Botswana's commitment to", "start": 865.76, "duration": 3.36}, {"text": "multilateralism.", "start": 866.88, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "We believe that shared challenges", "start": 869.12, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "require shared solutions. We also", "start": 871.68, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "believe that implementing the pact for", "start": 874.959, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "the future together with the UN80", "start": 878.079, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "initiative offers an opportunity to", "start": 880.72, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "translate our shared commitments into", "start": 883.279, "duration": 4.641}, {"text": "practical improvements in the", "start": 885.68, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "functioning of the United Nations.", "start": 887.92, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "In conclusion, Mr. President, I", "start": 891.76, "duration": 3.36}, {"text": "reemphasize", "start": 893.36, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "that restoring trust, managing", "start": 895.12, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "transformation, and delivering for all", "start": 897.92, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "are interconnected.", "start": 901.04, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "We restore trust when we uphold our", "start": 903.6, "duration": 7.039}, {"text": "commitments, respect the UN charter, and", "start": 906.8, "duration": 7.279}, {"text": "apply international law consistently.", "start": 910.639, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "We manage transformation when change", "start": 914.079, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "creates opportunity rather than deepens", "start": 916.639, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "inequality. When developing countries", "start": 919.519, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "have a meaningful voice in shaping the", "start": 922.16, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "system that affect their future and when", "start": 925.04, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "technological and economic progress", "start": 928.56, "duration": 6.959}, {"text": "serve humanity as a whole. And we", "start": 931.44, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "deliver for all when our decisions", "start": 935.519, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "translate into tangible improvements in", "start": 938.16, "duration": 7.119}, {"text": "peace, security, development, health,", "start": 940.639, "duration": 7.601}, {"text": "and human dignity.", "start": 945.279, "duration": 5.441}, {"text": "The difference our decisions make in the", "start": 948.24, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "lives and livelihoods of people is the", "start": 950.72, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "standard against which the credibility", "start": 953.92, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "of the United Nations must be measured.", "start": 956.079, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "Botswana is ready to work with all", "start": 959.68, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "member states. We may be small in size", "start": 962.32, "duration": 6.959}, {"text": "but we are steady in principle.", "start": 966.32, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "We offer partnership in governance that", "start": 969.279, "duration": 4.641}, {"text": "delivers experience in health", "start": 972.399, "duration": 4.481}, {"text": "innovation, responsible stewardship of", "start": 973.92, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "natural and mineral resources and", "start": 976.88, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "enduring preference for dialogue.", "start": 979.44, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "Let us ensure that history remembers", "start": 982.639, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "this 81st session for the trust we", "start": 985.839, "duration": 7.841}, {"text": "built, the promises kept, and the future", "start": 988.8, "duration": 9.64}, {"text": "created. I thank you.", "start": 993.68, "duration": 4.76}, {"text": "On behalf of the assembly,", "start": 1003.68, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "I wish to thank the president of the", "start": 1006.16, "duration": 6.119}, {"text": "Republic of Batswana.", "start": 1008.8, "duration": 3.479}]